### ==========================================
### 5. ACTUALIZAR INFORMACIÓN DE CONTACTO
### ==========================================

### 5.1 Actualizar solo teléfono (éxito)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/restaurante/contacto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telefono": "+52 55 1234 5678"
}

### 5.2 Actualizar solo email (éxito)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/restaurante/contacto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "contacto@restaurante.com"
}

### 5.3 Actualizar solo dirección (éxito)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/restaurante/contacto
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direccion": {
    "calle": "Av. Insurgentes Sur 1234",
    "ciudad": "Ciudad de México",
    "estado": "CDMX",
    "codigoPostal": "03100",
    "pais": "México"
  }
}

